# Typography

## Loading Fonts

### System Fonts

```javascript
textFont('Helvetica');
textFont('Georgia');
textFont('monospace');
```

### Custom Fonts (OTF/TTF/WOFF2)

```javascript
let myFont;

function preload() {
  myFont = loadFont('path/to/font.otf');
  // Requires local server or CORS-enabled URL
}

function setup() {
  textFont(myFont);
}
```

